message: "If you use this evaluation, please cite it as below, and cite PGxQA, from which the cases are derived."
title: "DeepDNA PGx eval: Claude models answering PGxQA pharmacogenomics questions with no tools, with the DeepDNA MCP server, and with web search"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "DeepDNA"
    email: "hello@deepdna.ai"
