abstract: "A small self-run comparison: 58 questions from PGxQA answered by three Claude models in three arms (no tools, DeepDNA MCP server only, web search only), graded by an automatic judge. Designed, run, graded and written up by an AI agent working for the DeepDNA project, which is an interested party."
